#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-content-collector.php:118
msgid "(removed item)"
msgstr "(item removido)"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-diff-applier.php:45
msgid "Diff operations must be a JSON object."
msgstr "As operações de diff devem ser um objeto JSON."

#. translators: %s: operations key
#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-diff-applier.php:64
#, php-format
msgid "Diff operations key \"%s\" must be an array of strings."
msgstr "A chave \"%s\" das operações de diff deve ser um array de strings."

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-diff-applier.php:74
msgid "Diff operations entries must be strings."
msgstr "As entradas das operações de diff devem ser strings."

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-diff-applier.php:85
msgid "The AI returned an empty diff."
msgstr "A IA retornou um diff vazio."

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-diff-applier.php:104
msgid "Current file content must be a string."
msgstr "O conteúdo atual do arquivo deve ser uma string."

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:311
msgid "The AI diff produced empty content."
msgstr "O diff da IA produziu conteúdo vazio."

#. translators: %s: file name
#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:378
#, php-format
msgid ""
"You maintain the %s file for a WordPress site. You return ONLY strict JSON "
"describing edits to the existing file."
msgstr ""
"Você mantém o arquivo %s de um site WordPress. Retorne SOMENTE JSON "
"estrito descrevendo as edições no arquivo existente."

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:387
msgid ""
"Return ONLY a JSON object with keys \"insert\" (array of strings to add) and "
"\"remove\" (array of exact strings to delete). Example: {\"insert\":[\"- New "
"page: Title (https://example.com/page)\"],\"remove\":[\"- Old page: Title "
"(https://example.com/page)\"]}. Do not include Markdown fences or commentary."
msgstr ""
"Retorne SOMENTE um objeto JSON com as chaves \"insert\" (array de "
"strings a adicionar) e \"remove\" (array de strings exatas a excluir). "
"Exemplo: {\"insert\":[\"- New page: Title "
"(https://example.com/page)\"],\"remove\":[\"- Old page: Title "
"(https://example.com/page)\"]}. Não inclua cercas Markdown nem "
"comentários."

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:416
msgid ""
"You generate SEO and LLM-friendly plain-text Markdown files for a WordPress "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Você gera arquivos Markdown em texto puro, amigáveis para SEO e "
"para LLMs, de um site WordPress."

#. translators: %s: file name
#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:420
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Generate the complete %s file content for the following WordPress site. Use "
"the llms.txt convention: an H1 site title, a blockquote summary, and "
"Markdown lists of links with short descriptions."
msgstr ""
"Gere o conteúdo completo do arquivo %s para o seguinte site "
"WordPress. Use a convenção llms.txt: um título H1 do site, um "
"resumo em citação e listas Markdown de links com descrições curtas."

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:424
msgid ""
"Return ONLY the raw file content. Do not include Markdown fences, "
"explanations or commentary."
msgstr ""
"Retorne SOMENTE o conteúdo bruto do arquivo. Não inclua cercas "
"Markdown, explicações nem comentários."

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:455
msgid "The AI API URL is not configured."
msgstr "A URL da API de IA não está configurada."

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:462
msgid "The AI API key is not configured."
msgstr "A chave da API de IA não está configurada."

#. translators: %s: error message
#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:492
#, php-format
msgid "AI request failed: %s"
msgstr "A requisição à IA falhou: %s"

#. translators: 1: HTTP status code, 2: response body
#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:506
#, php-format
msgid "The AI API returned HTTP %1$d: %2$s"
msgstr "A API de IA retornou HTTP %1$d: %2$s"

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:519
msgid "The AI API returned a malformed response."
msgstr "A API de IA retornou uma resposta malformada."

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-generator.php:550
msgid "The AI returned invalid JSON operations."
msgstr "A IA retornou operações JSON inválidas."

#: includes/icc-gg-llm-files-generator-settings-page.php:117
